# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules for GlobeCareer (root copy).
#
# The deployed file is public/_redirects, which Vite copies into dist/ and which
# Cloudflare Pages reads from the build output. This root copy is kept identical
# so the two can never disagree.
#
# Cloudflare Pages CANNOT redirect by hostname from this file: a source must be
# a path, and domain-level rules are explicitly unsupported
# (developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects). The www -> apex 301
# is therefore a zone-level Redirect Rule in the Cloudflare dashboard
# (Rules -> Redirect Rules, 301, preserve path and query).

# Machine-readable discovery files
/.well-known/security.txt  /.well-known/security.txt  200
/.well-known/ard.json      /.well-known/ard.json      200
/security.txt              /security.txt              200
/robots.txt                /robots.txt                200
/sitemap.xml               /sitemap.xml               200
/llms.txt                  /llms.txt                  200
/llms-full.txt             /llms-full.txt             200

# No SPA catch-all: every valid path is prerendered to its own HTML file at
# build time, and unmatched paths are served by 404.html with a real 404 status.
#
# Duplicate-URL 301 rules (alias paths and trailing-slash variants) are appended
# to the build output at build time by scripts/prerender.mjs.
